[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop.event. PlayerOpenShopEvent for shop container access control.

[_conclusions]
Provides extension point for protection plugins to integrate with shop container access without modifying core code.

[_does]
Fired when a player attempts to open a shop's container. Allows external listeners to request direct container open or cancel the event to hard-deny access.

[_summary]
Custom events for the Shop plugin. Defines PlayerOpenShopEvent for external listeners to intercept shop container open attempts.

